  "source": "[\\converges.to{L}:for{S ::= a(n_)}]\nStates:\nwhen:\n. L is \\real\n. S is \\real.sequence\nthat:\n. forAll: epsilon is \\real\n  where: epsilon \\:real.greater?:/ \\real.zero\n  then:\n  . exists: N is \\natural\n    suchThat:\n    . forAll: n is \\natural\n      where: N \\:natural.leq?:/ n\n      then: \\real.abs(a(n) \\.real.-./ L) \\:real.less?:/ epsilon\nDocumented:\n. called: \"$S?$ converges to $L?$\"\n. written: \"a?_{n_?} \\to L?\"\n. description: \"The sequence $a_n$ converges to limit $L$ as $n \\to \\infty$.\"\nId: \"f046faf8-5c18-4597-ac14-4feda980148d\"",
